  "description": "Do you want maximum safety when e-mountain biking, but don't want to compromise on performance? With the Sonic AM 2 ABS, you can have both. Equipped with the latest generation of the Bosch anti-lock braking system, the trail experience is even better. Designed for fast downhill rides, the system automatically regulates the braking pressure of the powerful four-piston brakes and ensures additional safety in demanding terrain. You can use your braking technique as usual.\n\nThe latest Bosch Performance Line CX Gen5 motor in combination with the powerful 800 Wh battery provides you with the power for robust off-road adventures - for long tours, lots of trails and metres in altitude. Thanks to the completely newly developed, lightweight carbon main frame, you benefit from agile riding behaviour and optimum handling. Together with the powerful chassis with 150 mm suspension travel, you are ready for any challenge. With the integrated MonkeyLink cornering light, you always have another exclusive safety feature on board. This means that visibility and visibility are always guaranteed, even on sporty rides and tours. Just like the MonkeyLink Twinlights with brake light function integrated in the dropout, the cornering light in the head tube is powered directly from the battery. The clever MonkeyLink 2.0 interface for an additional front light or inductive smartphone charging completes the smart details.",
